---
import LinkButton from '../ui/LinkButton.astro'
import { LINKS } from '../../lib/constants'
---
<section class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#0B2A3C] min-h-[calc(100svh-5rem)] flex items-center justify-center py-12 sm:py-16">
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
    <span class="eyebrow inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-[#7FE0AC]/35 !text-[#7FE0AC] mb-6 sm:mb-8 animate-fade-in-up">
      <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
        <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-[#2FBF71] opacity-75"></span>
        <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-[#2FBF71]"></span>
      </span>
      Vendes más pero la caja no lo refleja
    </span>

    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-6 sm:mb-8 max-w-4xl animate-fade-in-up animation-delay-100">
      Acelera la conversión de tus ventas en <span class="text-[#7FE0AC]">liquidez  </span>
    </h1>

    <p class="text-base sm:text-xl md:text-2xl text-[#C7D6DF] leading-relaxed mb-8 sm:mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto animate-fade-in-up animation-delay-200">
      Cada día que tardas en facturar es tu dinero en la calle. En <strong class="text-white">zalantos</strong> conectamos tus sistemas y automatizamos tus procesos, desde la venta hasta el cobro, para que ese dinero vuelva a tu caja.
    </p>

    <div class="flex w-full sm:w-auto flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center animate-fade-in-up animation-delay-300">
      <LinkButton href={LINKS.contact} variant="primary" class="w-full sm:w-auto">
        Contactanos
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
        </svg>
      </LinkButton>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
